  "cause": {
    "proximate_text": "The isolation was caused by the CSR 'A' drain tank level control system, which was unable to maintain level below the Hi-Hi isolation signal. Deficiencies were identified with the level control system and drain flow paths, resulting in the inability of the system to respond to Hi and Hi-Hi level conditions rapidly.",
    "cause_code": "E",
    "category": "Management/QA Deficiency",
    "theme": "aggregate degraded components not managed by system oversight",
    "provisional": false
