    "Q3",
    "Q4",
    "Q14"
  ],
  "notes": "Cause code E (Management/QA Deficiency) governs despite multiple hardware failures narrated; theme reflects the licensee's framing of aggregate degraded conditions not managed by system oversight. Emergency Gland Sealing line and Auxiliary Boiler supply are treated as involved failure contributors (unavailable backups), not as BACKED_UP_BY since neither was operable/available during the event window. STV112 failure and drain-tank level control failure are modeled as parallel contributing failure modes both feeding the Hi-Hi isolation chain, per rule 5. Two prior similar LERs captured as stub nodes with keys exactly as stated in narrative (unit-prefixed format)."
